flowchart TD
  ENV[user environment] --> CLI{claude on PATH?}
  CLI -->|no| BLK1[BLOCKED: claude CLI missing]
  CLI -->|yes| IPF[~/.claude/plugins/installed_plugins.json]
  IPF -->|present| READ[parse payload]
  IPF -->|missing| BLK2[BLOCKED: plugin index missing]
  READ -->|orbit listed| INST[orbit_installed=true]
  READ -->|orbit absent| BLK3[BLOCKED: orbit not installed]
  INST --> CMD[slash command discovery]
  CMD -->|interactive only| BLK4[BLOCKED: provide manual cmd]
  INST --> SK[skill discovery]
  SK -->|internal to agent loop| BLK5[BLOCKED: provide manual cmd]
  INST --> HK[hook configuration]
  HK -->|internal| BLK6[BLOCKED: provide manual cmd]
  BLK1 --> RPT[orbit-installed-plugin-validation.md]
  BLK2 --> RPT
  BLK3 --> RPT
  BLK4 --> RPT
  BLK5 --> RPT
  BLK6 --> RPT
  INST --> RPT
